        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon cats on a quest that is as cute as it is challenging and fun. Complete puzzles to unlock more furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to become a crazy cat person or just make a few furry friends you can summon the best cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> - Just drag and drop pieces and rotate with right click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Levels</strong> - Procedurally generated levels allow for endless replayability </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm Atmosphere</strong> - soothing background music makes puzzles relaxed and soothing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Cats</strong>  -  Lots of cats to summon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
